  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# MediatOR\nA minimalistic implementation of the mediator design pattern. \n\n## V 0.1\nThis currently works with single query/command and corresponding handler.<br/> \nPipelineBehaviours and other features will be released in future versions. \n\n### Register library with IServiceCollection\n`services.AddMediatOR(assembly: typeof(***ClassName***).Assembly);`\n\n#### Implemenation \n```\n    public record CreateUserCommand(string firstName, string lastName, string emailAddress, string password, string confirmPassword) : IRequest<AppResponse<bool>> { }\n\n    public async Task<AppResponse<bool>> RegisterUser(CreateUserCommand createUserCommand)\n    {\n        return await mediator.Send(createUserCommand, CancellationToken.None);\n    }\n```\n---",
